# The gVisor release gVisor sandbox servers run, and the sha512 of its
# gvisor.tar.zstd for each architecture (from the release's .sha512
# files). Read by gvisor-assets.sh and bundle.sh. A paused gVisor sandbox
# only resumes under the same release, so changing it ends the pauses of
# servers that update.
